          "unit": "mW",
          "min": 99.5,
          "max": 100.5
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "Spec: ±0.5% or ±0.02 dB within the calibration range; in ranges 4 and 5 add the sensor linearity.",
        "The 3 µW, 30 µW, 300 µW, 3 mW and 30 mW legends are approximations: the true outputs are 3.16, 31.6, 316 µW, 3.16 and 31.6 mW (p. 4-7).",
        "Not necessary to check accuracy in dBm (same circuitry)."
      ]
    }
  ],
  "notCovered": [
