  "ambiguities": [
    "Zero carryover post-zero check prints as '0.0[1 ±06 µW' (OCR); read as 0.00 ±0.06 µW.",
    "REF CF and CAL FAC values print as OCR garbage; read as 100.0% (the Service Manual says REF CF 100.0%).",
    "3 µW limits 3.10 / 3.23 µW are asymmetric about 3.16 µW; encoded as printed."
  ]
